Data

- Prices: the task packs under data/ are derived from ERCOT's Day-Ahead Market settlement point prices for the
  hubs and load zones (report NP4-180-ER, "Historical DAM Load Zone and Hub Prices"), published by the Electric
  Reliability Council of Texas, Inc. (ERCOT) at https://www.ercot.com/mp/data-products/data-product-details?id=NP4-180-ER.
  ERCOT does not endorse this product or any result derived from it, and is not responsible for its accuracy.
- Battery archetypes: sized from the U.S. Energy Information Administration's Form EIA-860 annual electric
  generator data (https://www.eia.gov/electricity/data/eia860/), a work of the U.S. Government in the public
  domain.
